      "text": "to retain store and act as agent, D&C 63:42–46 (64:26). is called to be bishop, D&C 72:8. to travel and administer to poor, D&C 84:112. to go to New York City, Albany, Boston, D&C 84:114. needs to be chastened and to set family in order, D&C 93:50. in charge of temple lot at Kirtland, D&C 96:2. stewardship of, D&C 104:39–42. revelation on duties of, D&C 117. to settle business and journey from Kirtland, D&C 117:1. to repent of covetous desires, D&C 117:4. is warned about secret abominations, D&C 117:11. to be bishop in Adam-ondi-Ahman, D&C 117:11.",
